§ 4.D. Cartan-Serre Finiteness Theorem

The above results enable us to prove a finiteness theorem for cohomology groups over
compact analytic schemes.

(4.8) Theorem (Cartan-Serre). Let
S be a coherent analytic sheaf over an analytic
scheme (X,
OX). If X is compact, all cohomology groups Hk(X,
S) are finite dimensional
(and Hausdorff ).

