+---
+id: lem-qftx-gaga-coherent-section-topology-well-defined
+kind: lemma
+title: Coherent-section quotient topologies are Fréchet and presentation-independent
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+dependency_level: 3
+deps:
