+    - title: Henri Cartan, Un théorème de finitude
+      url: https://www.numdam.org/item/SHC_1953-1954__6__A17_0.pdf
+      locator: "Exposé 17, pp. 1–3: coherent analytic cohomology is computed through acyclic local section data."
