+---
+id: def-qftx-gaga-frechet-space
+kind: definition
+title: Fréchet spaces used in analytic coherent cohomology
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+dependency_level: 0
+deps: []
+dependency_roles: {}
+justified_by: []
